\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Summary:
\f1\b0  The notebook establishes a baseline test using the Qwen/Qwen3-8B model without any Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). It systematically compares four distinct prompting strategies using an 80-query evaluation dataset based on the GitLab HR Handbook. The four strategies are Baseline Direct (zero-shot plain instruction), Few-Shot Structured (providing 1-2 examples), Chain-of-Thought (forcing step-by-step reasoning), and Decomposition Prompting (breaking questions into sub-tasks). \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Results:
\f1\b0  All four prompt templates were successfully defined and configured to route through the OpenAI-compatible API to the target 8B endpoint. \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Topic 2: Evaluation Metrics & Execution
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Summary:
\f1\b0  The notebook evaluates model performance using an "SS Baseline Accuracy" metric, which approximates factual correctness. An answer is flagged as correct if it meets a token-level recall of \uc0\u8805  0.55 while matching all key numbers from the gold standard answer, or if the content-word F1 score is \u8805  0.50. \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Results:
\f1\b0  The evaluation processed all 80 evaluation queries across the four different prompt strategies, resulting in 320 total API calls and logging the F1 score, recall, and number-matching boolean for each prediction. \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

